Hi Phil,

The dimensions of the latent trace are independent. I don't want to insert restrictions on correlations or covariates between trait dimensions. I want to restrict the value of discrimination parameters (a_jd = 0, for some item j and dimension d). Do you know how to do this using the mirt.model() function? For example, if item 5 does not influence dimension 2 of the latent trait, I would like to define a[5,2] = 0.

Marcelo

